 "_notes": "Exact dynamic programming over rank-count vectors (the wealth of the plug-in and fixed bets depends only on the counts). grouped = per-position laws for positions 1-5 / 6-7 / 8-9 (planting rates 4 / 2 / 1) estimated in sample (add-0.1); perpos = each position's 20 ranks shrunk towards the pooled law; iid = pooled law (add-0.5). thm2v_tightened uses |S_n| <= min(n, M) and the observed-support prior term with max(0, log 1/b_r). fixed_prior_*_azuma: Azuma bound for a non-learning bet (no regret term), c = log(max f / min f). E_tau_bound = sum_n min(1, tail bound) (Thm 2(vi)). exact_threshold_W: smallest wealth threshold with exact null size <= alpha within a 9-canary budget (valid only for that fixed budget)."
